### Why this is enterprise-grade:
 * **Zero Hardcoding:** The UI doesn't know anything about how many workflows exist.
 * **Highly Performant:** It uses Promise.all and a Set so that if you have 1,000 rows all using Workflow_3, it only makes **1 single API call** to the backend instead of 1,000.
 * **Future-Proof:** If your database admin creates a 10-step Workflow_5 tomorrow, the frontend will automatically fetch it and instantly draw a 10-dot stepper.
